OL,3,GNEWSAVigil held for family who died in
OL,4,Asea off Shoreham
OL,5,
OL,6,FReverend Pat Alden said: "When
OL,7,Fsomething happens, whether it's
OL,8,Fsomething we celebrate... or tragic
OL,9,Fcircumstances like this, the community
OL,10,Fcomes together."
